    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay if i do the needle thing, how deep should i go? i don't want to leave any of the stuff inside or have it just seal back up. also if it starts bleeding a lot or if i start feeling kinda shivery/feverish, is that just normal while it's draining or should i be worried about something serious like sepsis?",
